Class Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  OBJECT CLASS POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Super Class Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Instance Variables Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      2      |  Class Methods Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      3      |  External Methods Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      4      |  Internal Methods Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      5      |  Pointer to Classes Print Name
	+-------------+


Instance Variables Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  OBJECT CLASS POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Search Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Number of Variables
	+-------------+
	|      2      |  Pointer to Variable Print Name
	+-------------+
	|      3      |  Pointer to Variables Type Print Name
	+-------------+
	|      4      |  Offset
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|     N-2     | Pointer to last Variable Print Name
	+-------------+
	|     N-1     | Pointer to last Var Type Print Name
	+-------------+
	|      N      | Offset
	+-------------+
Methods Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Number of Methods
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Template Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      2      |  Block Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|     N-1     |  Pointer to last Template
	+-------------+
	|      N      |  Pointer to last Block
	+-------------+


Template Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Primary Message String Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  <NULL> | Parameter Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      2      |           Parameter Offset
	+-------------+
	|      3      |           Parameter Type Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      4      |  <NULL> | Message Delimeter Print name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      5      |  <NULL> | Second Parameter Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      6      |           Second Parameter Offset
	+-------------+
	|      7      |           Second Parameter Type Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|      N      |   NULL   N=4n where n is the number of parameters
	+-------------+          N=1 no parameters or
                             N=4n+1 if an ending dilimiter is present
Block Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Number of Statements N
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Block Instance Variables Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      2      |  Expression Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      3      |  Expression Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|     N+2     |  Expression Pointer
	+-------------+


Expression Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Dale Syntatic Object Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Dale Syntatic Object Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      2      |  Dale Syntatic Object Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|      N      |  NULL
	+-------------+


Goto Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS POINTER POINTER 
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Label Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Offset
	+-------------+

Label Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS POINTER POINTER 
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Label Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Offset
	+-------------+


Variable Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS POINTER POINTER 
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Variable Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Offset
	+-------------+


Parameter Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS POINTER POINTER 
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Parameter Print Name Pointer
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Offset
	+-------------+


Integer Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Integer Value
	+-------------+

String Object

	+-------------+
	|     -1      |  CLASS OBJECT POINTER
	+-------------+
	|      0      |  Character Value
	+-------------+
	|      1      |  Character Value
	+-------------+
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	|      .      |
	+-------------+
	|      N      |  NULL
	+-------------+

